      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "> But in some cases Performance Rank does not function properly, such as when we want to allow values greater than the limit for skinned meshes for reasons like costume-part toggle gimmicks while still limiting polygons.\n\nYou can have 1 or 2 skinned mesh renderers with UV Discards to do performant toggles in a shader. lilToon, Poiyomi Toon both support UV Discard.",
