  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The Avatar Performance Gated feature was announced in DevUpd on 9 April 2026.\n\nThat feature can limit avatars by Performance Rank.\n\nBut in some cases Performance Rank does not function properly, such as when we want to allow values greater than the limit for skinned meshes for reasons like costume-part toggle gimmicks while still limiting polygons.\n\nTherefore, we want a custom performance limits profile feature that can set limitation values by item for more flexible performance limits at events.",
